 configurações continuam no perfil do Windows. Após concluir, feche o OuO atual e abra a nova cópia.","\n\nThe download is checked against the SHA-256 published on GitHub. The current version is backed up and the new version is extracted into a separate folder. Your settings stay in your Windows profile. Once complete, close the current OuO and open the new copy.")))return;ouoUpdateCancel=new CancellationTokenSource();var cancellation=ouoUpdateCancel;string prepared=null;Work(T("Preparar atualização do OuO","Prepare OuO update"),()=>{prepared=OuOUpdates.Prepare(release,WorkReporting.Sink,cancellation.Token);return "OK • "+T("Atualização verificada e preparada. Abra a nova pasta após fechar esta versão.","Update verified and prepared. Open the new folder after closing this version.")+"\n"+prepared;},r=>{cancellation.Dispose();ouoUpdateCancel=null;ShowNotice(r);if(prepared!=null)Open(prepared);});}),Button(T("Cancelar download","Cancel download"),()=>{if(ouoUpdateCancel!=null)ouoUpdateCancel.Cancel();}),Button(T("Versões anteriores salvas","Saved previous versions"),()=>{Directory.CreateDirectory(OuOUpdates.Folder);Open(OuOUpdates.Folder);}),Button(T("Repositório oficial","Official repository"),()=>Open(OuOUpdates.Repository)));
